# VecAttention's vllm_flash_attn kernel is an EXTERNAL optional CUDA dependency,
# not vendored in-tree (it is a 440MB compiled fork: vLLM-FA Apache + Dao
# FlashAttention BSD-3 + CUTLASS BSD-3). It is consumed as an environment-
# installed package (`pip install vllm_flash_attn`, or a local editable build of
# the fork). The directories below may exist on a contributor's disk as a local
# build but must never be tracked — see algorithms/vecattention/NOTICE. Both the
# current (algorithms/) layout and the pre-refactor (sparsity/vecattention/ops/)
# layout are ignored, since a fork clone may linger at the old path on disk.
angelslim/compressor/sparsity/algorithms/vecattention/ops/vllm-flash-attention/
angelslim/compressor/sparsity/vecattention/ops/vllm-flash-attention/